                "text": "Aftermath of a small D -Day workout. 80 burpees over the wall (see last post). This little bit of punishment wouldn\u2019t even compare to 5 seconds of what our boys endured during D Day. What an unbelievable group of men. \n\nMore to come. Maybe the next challenge should involve Omaha Beach\u2026?",
