                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Over the weekend, I had the chance to join some outstanding @HumbleISD JROTC students for a Saturday morning workout. Let me tell you, it\u2019s pretty inspiring to see young men and women choosing to push themselves, to embrace the challenge, and to show up when it\u2019s not easy.\n\nWorkouts like this aren\u2019t just about getting stronger\u2014they\u2019re about accountability, teamwork, and learning that the hardest things in life are often the most rewarding. There\u2019s a reason the military focuses on shared suffering\u2014it builds trust, resilience, and bonds that last a lifetime.\n\nNothing is given. Everything is earned.",
