                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "omg not once did I ever sleep on a floor on deployment. On many ops in rural Afghanistan we made sure to book up Four Seasons well in advance.\n\nYeah\u2026\n\nThese National Guardsmen are doing just fine and I\u2019m sure thrilled to be part of a historic move to bring law and order to chaos. They are serving with honor and integrity.",
